@anchor{dokgen_stats_analyze-file}
@deffn Procedure analyze-file path
Return what the file at @var{path} is made of.

@strong{path} (string): A path to a file of Scheme source.

@strong{Return value} (alist): Its name, the counts of
@code{analyze-source} and its size in bytes.

@anchor{dk_source_dokgen_stats_analyze-file}
@example 
(define (analyze-file path)
  "Return what the file at @@var@{path@} is made of.

  @@strong@{path@} (string):
    A path to a file of Scheme source.

  @@strong@{Return value@} (alist):
    Its name, the counts of @@code@{analyze-source@} and its size in bytes."
  (let [(text (call-with-input-file path get-string-all))
        (size (stat:size (stat path)))]
    `((name . ,path)
      ,@@(analyze-source text)
      (bytes . ,size))))
@end example

@end deffn


